      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ridgeville’s early growth was spurred by steamboats on the Coosa River in 1845 and railroads in the 1850s, linking it to markets in Montgomery and Atlanta.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
